{"id":75827444591607,"type":"artist","name":"Erroll Garner","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":31,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Portrait_of_Erroll_Garner%2C_New_York%2C_N.Y.%2C_between_1946_and_1948_%28gottlieb%29.jpg?width=500","bio":"Erroll Garner (Pittsburgh, 15 de junio de 1921 - Los Ángeles, 7 de enero de 1977), pianista estadounidense de jazz, estilísticamente centrado en el swing y el bop. A pesar de no saber leer música, fue un músico sofisticado y popular, que mantuvo su estilo inalterado hasta el final de su carrera.\n\nSus primeros trabajos fueron en el medio radiofónico a los diez años de edad y en algunos clubes de Pittsburgh. Se trasladó en 1944 a Nueva York y tocó con el trío de Slam Stewart entre 1944 y 1945","tags":["jazz","jazz piano","piano","swing","instrumental"]},"works":[{"id":173820484948505,"type":"album","name":"Piano Solos","artist":"Erroll Garner","year":1946,"weight":5,"yt":"JUCVJpMJfeo","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":265238898886802,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Stride","rank":34,"scaruffi":null},{"id":280702155250789,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Ragtime","rank":51,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":202865411764021,"type":"album","name":"Playing Piano Solos","artist":"Erroll Garner","year":1949,"weight":5,"yt":"P_tAU3GM9XI","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":265238898886802,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Stride","rank":44,"scaruffi":null},{"id":280702155250789,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Ragtime","rank":74,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":165560205975261,"type":"album","name":"Playing Piano Solos, Vol. 3","artist":"Erroll Garner","year":1949,"weight":5,"yt":"lw0YpJiaWLk","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":265238898886802,"name":"RYM Top — Jazz — Stride","rank":77,"scaruffi":null},{"id":280702155250789,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Ragtime","rank":152,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":39671